[{"slug":"front_page","title":{"rendered":"Home"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\n\n\n","protected":false}},{"slug":"gallery","title":{"rendered":"Projet"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-align-center\">V6 Project \u2014 Toward a new generation of hydroplanes<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-wide wp-block-paragraph\">For six years A\u00e9roboat France has been developing ground-effect aircraft prototypes. After successfully flying and testing experimental models (HV3 and HV4), we are now launching the development of the V6 a model designed as a true milestone in our journey.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-wide wp-block-paragraph\">The objective of the V6 is simple to state but ambitious to achieve: to build a reliable, high-performance, and modular hydroplane capable of pushing the current limits of ground-effect technology.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-default is-content-justification-center\" id=\"page-title-section\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-d4625b91 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"wp-block-image \">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"635\" src=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/imageprojet4-edited.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-323\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/imageprojet4-edited.jpg 960w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/imageprojet4-edited-300x198.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/imageprojet4-edited-768x508.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-column-is-layout-e4ac910b wp-block-column-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-xx-large-font-size\">Why a V6 ?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Each prototype we have built has been an opportunity for us to learn.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The <strong>V3 <\/strong>taught us the importance of a rigid structure and properly sized floats.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The <strong>V4 <\/strong>validated several technical solutions (such as tail design, buoyancy, and ease of assembly), but it also revealed certain limitations, particularly regarding waterproofing, wing rigidity, and payload capacity.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">The V6 is therefore conceived as a synthesis. It builds on past successes, corrects previous shortcomings, and paves the way for new innovations.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-default is-content-justification-center\" id=\"general-section\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-d4625b91 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-column-is-layout-0662323e wp-block-column-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our objectives:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Aerodynamic performance: <\/strong>optimize wing geometry (aspect ratio, dihedral, sweep) and explore new configurations (downward winglets, integrated floats).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Versatility:<\/strong> design a model capable of flying efficiently both in ground effect and out of ground effect, to validate our calculations and expand its range of use.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Reliability and simplicity: <\/strong>ensure quick assembly (under 30 minutes), robust connections, and improved overall stiffness.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Optimized buoyancy: <\/strong>maintain an overall density lower than that of water by using watertight foams, and ensure a low waterline even in the presence of waves.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Increased payload: <\/strong>aim for a carrying capacity of over 2 kg while keeping the total weight under 2 kg \u2013 a true challenge in lightweight design.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-rounded\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"706\" src=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-10-18-a-14.50.45_51d921c8.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-322\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-10-18-a-14.50.45_51d921c8.jpg 1600w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-10-18-a-14.50.45_51d921c8-300x132.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-10-18-a-14.50.45_51d921c8-1024x452.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-10-18-a-14.50.45_51d921c8-768x339.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-10-18-a-14.50.45_51d921c8-1536x678.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-default is-content-justification-center\" id=\"page-title-section\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-d4625b91 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-bottom is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\" src=\"https:\/\/robincanovas4688bc2a29-qwrgm.wordpress.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/whatsapp-image-2025-10-26-at-12.55.49-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-163\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3\/4;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/whatsapp-image-2025-10-26-at-12.55.49-1.jpeg 1600w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/whatsapp-image-2025-10-26-at-12.55.49-1-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/whatsapp-image-2025-10-26-at-12.55.49-1-1024x1024.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/whatsapp-image-2025-10-26-at-12.55.49-1-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/whatsapp-image-2025-10-26-at-12.55.49-1-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/whatsapp-image-2025-10-26-at-12.55.49-1-1536x1536.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-column-is-layout-e4ac910b wp-block-column-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-xx-large-font-size\">Innovations of the V6<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Low wings<\/strong> of 100 cm on each side, with a 50 cm chord, to maximize ground effect while maintaining good stability.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>T-tail<\/strong> made of carbon fiber, designed to remain rigid while avoiding disturbances from the wing&#8217;s wake.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Removable landing gear<\/strong> engineered to preserve watertightness.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Enhanced watertightness<\/strong> of the wing joints and electronic cockpit using solutions inspired by nautical engineering.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Streamlined floats<\/strong> to improve hydrodynamics and reduce water spray, with internal cavities to prevent the risk of sinking.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>In-flight adjustable angle of incidence<\/strong>, an innovation pathway that would allow lift adaptation to different flight phases.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Advanced electronic architecture<\/strong> with dual Arduino, automatic recordings on SD card, and considerations for using motors to maneuver when stationary. Corrects previous flaws and paves the way for new innovations.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false}},{"slug":"team","title":{"rendered":"\u00c9quipe"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-default is-content-justification-center\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-team-heading\">Our Members<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-a467a4fc wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/robincanovas4688bc2a29-qwrgm.wordpress.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photoclement.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-89\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center ai-ignore has-small-font-size\"><br>Cl\u00e9ment THIBAULT<br><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/robincanovas4688bc2a29-qwrgm.wordpress.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photojoan.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-90\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photojoan.jpeg 800w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photojoan-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photojoan-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photojoan-768x768.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center ai-ignore has-small-font-size\"><br>Joan LE POUHA\u00cbR<br><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1014\" height=\"676\" src=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photo4-edited.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-93\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photo4-edited.jpg 1014w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photo4-edited-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photo4-edited-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1014px) 100vw, 1014px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center ai-ignore has-small-font-size\"><br>Pierre STAMM<br><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photokerian.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-91\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photokerian.jpeg 800w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photokerian-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photokerian-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/photokerian-768x768.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center ai-ignore has-small-font-size\"><br>Kerian FITER<br><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-a467a4fc wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/robincanovas4688bc2a29-qwrgm.wordpress.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/photomathis.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-104\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/photomathis.jpeg 800w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/photomathis-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/photomathis-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/photomathis-768x768.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center ai-ignore has-small-font-size\"><br>Mathis WOJTKOWSKI<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1088\" src=\"https:\/\/robincanovas4688bc2a29-qwrgm.wordpress.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/img_5246.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-124\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/img_5246.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/img_5246-300x170.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/img_5246-1024x580.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/img_5246-768x435.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/img_5246-1536x870.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center ai-ignore has-small-font-size\"><br>Benjamin CANOVAS<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"904\" height=\"885\" src=\"https:\/\/robincanovas4688bc2a29-qwrgm.wordpress.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/image.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-105\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/image.png 904w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/image-300x294.png 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/image-768x752.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 904px) 100vw, 904px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center ai-ignore has-small-font-size\"><br>Chislain Jaures KAMDEM KAM<br><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1008\" height=\"570\" src=\"https:\/\/robincanovas4688bc2a29-qwrgm.wordpress.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/img_52251.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-97\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/img_52251.jpg 1008w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/img_52251-300x170.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/img_52251-768x434.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1008px) 100vw, 1008px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center ai-ignore has-small-font-size\"><br>Robin CANOVAS<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-section-3 is-content-justification-center\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-d4625b91 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"514\" height=\"486\" src=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/logoabf-without-bg-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-39\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/logoabf-without-bg-1.png 514w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/logoabf-without-bg-1-300x284.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 514px) 100vw, 514px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide\">Who we are ?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We\u2019re a team made up mainly of students\u2014passionate about aeronautics, model making, and the science of ground effect. We design, build, and test large-span scale aircraft to deepen our understanding through hands-on work.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false}},{"slug":"general","title":{"rendered":"Partenaires"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-default is-content-justification-center\" id=\"page-title-section\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-d4625b91 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-bottom is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/robincanovas4688bc2a29-qwrgm.wordpress.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/chatgpt-image-26-oct.-2025-14_46_56.png?w=1024\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-150\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.9340268045051217\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/chatgpt-image-26-oct.-2025-14_46_56.png 1024w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/chatgpt-image-26-oct.-2025-14_46_56-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/chatgpt-image-26-oct.-2025-14_46_56-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/aeroboat-france.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/chatgpt-image-26-oct.-2025-14_46_56-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-column-is-layout-e4ac910b wp-block-column-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-xx-large-font-size\">3DEXPERIENCE<\/h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We warmly thank 3DX for supporting Joan and me for the past 4 years. Thanks to their commitment, we receive valuable technical guidance every year, and in November they will provide licenses for all interested association members (20 licenses available). Their continuous support allows us to realize our projects with professional-grade tools and ensure the quality of our developments.<\/p>\n\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n\n","protected":false}}]